NegroniMetal change to ios-flame 745c434 phone/metal2 (on top of flame/0001-0011), applied by scripts/metal/fetch-sources.sh:
Metal protocol conformance for the frontend's objects.
MetalPerformanceShaders (20H392 MPSCore) asks `conformsToProtocol:@protocol(MTLCommandBuffer)` in
-[MPSCommandBufferImageCache initWithCommandBuffer:computeEncoder:], logs "commandBuffer does not conform to the
MTLCommandBuffer protocol" and answers nil on NO; MPSAutoCache's constructor then dereferences the nil: SpringBoard
-[SUICOrbView _drawSiriFrame:] SIGSEGV far 0x18 (2026-10-26 13:24:43, the Siri orb). The NB* classes implement the
selectors one by one and never declared the protocols (NBFunction and NBArgumentEncoder did). This change adopts the public
protocol of every frontend class at run time (class_addProtocol, next to the MTLTextureImplementation adoption):
MTLBuffer, MTLTexture, MTLLibrary, MTLComputePipelineState, MTLRenderPipelineState, MTLSamplerState, MTLDepthStencilState,
MTLEvent, MTLSharedEvent, MTLFence, MTLCommandQueue, MTLCommandBuffer, MTLHeap, MTLCommandEncoder,
MTLComputeCommandEncoder, MTLRenderCommandEncoder, MTLBlitCommandEncoder, MTLBinaryArchive, MTLArgumentEncoder, MTLFunction.
Log line: `native-metal: Metal protocols adopted by N of 20 frontend classes`.
With the protocol accepted, MPS goes on to the device's heap placement sizes (MPSTemporaryImage) and three compute-encoder
selectors the frontend lacked: the host test raised `-[NativeBridgeMetalDevice heapTextureSizeAndAlignWithDescriptor:]:
unrecognized selector`. Added: heapTextureSizeAndAlignWithDescriptor: / heapBufferSizeAndAlignWithLength:options: /
heapAccelerationStructureSizeAndAlignWithSize: (an estimate: linear bytes-per-row from the runtime, every level, slice and
sample, 16 KiB aligned; placement itself is checked by nmb_heap_new_texture/buffer), and the no-ops
memoryBarrierWithResources:count:, setImageblockWidth:height:, setStageInRegion: on the compute encoder. Selector gaps still go through
doesNotRecognizeSelector: (MISSING line, then the exception). Host test: scripts/metal/host-plugin-test.sh case `mps`.

